        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/tipton-county-museum-covington/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Covington lies 12 miles east of the Mississippi River and 42 miles northeast of Memphis, making it part of the Memphis metropolitan area.",
